  "title": "Carrot Bars",
  "description": "This moist oil-based cake uses baby food jars of strained carrots in lieu of grated fresh carrot creating a more even texture and a diminished flavor of carrot. The fool proof cream cheese frosting is the perfect match for these bars.",
  "authors": [
    "Kathy"
  ],
